<title>GERMANY: Preussag H1 96/97 net profit up 17.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Preussag H1 96/97 net profit up 17.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996/97 year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   159     vs 135</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    248     vs 221</p>
<p>    Group sales				  11,812  vs 11,573</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			    13,500  vs 12,700</p>
<p>NOTE - Steel group Preussag said in a statement the recovery in its business led it to be confident that the positive trend in its results would continue in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom +49 228 260 97 150</p>
</text>
